rs-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Remove obsolete encoding-event absence assertions](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/pull/20533#discussion_r4252130138)\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Low severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Document removal of Lettuce 5.1 selector](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/pull/20533#discussion_r4252130250)\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Low severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Retain Jedis 1.x deprecation guidance](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/pull/20533#discussion_r4252130199)\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Previously missed (1)</strong></summary>\n\nIn code that hasn't changed since last review\n\n<details>\n<summary><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> Add AUTH coverage for the Lettuce 5.0 advice path</summary>\n\n`instrumentation/\u200blettuce/\u200blettuce-5.0/\u200bjavaagent/\u200bbuild.gradle.kts:60`\n\n[Testing] These replacement suites reuse `src/test/java`, which has no AUTH case, while this PR deletes the only installed-agent `AbstractLettuceSyncClientAuthTest` subclass. The remaining library test exercises the removed native-tracing implementation, not the Lettuce 5.0 advice path now used for 5.1+, so credential masking and AUTH error telemetry can regress unnoticed. Add an agent AUTH test to the shared 5.0 test sources so `lettuce51Test` exercises it before removing the old module.\n</details>\n</details>\n\n\ud83e\udde0 **Review effort:** Balanced","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5496086099","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5496086099}],"frozen_at":1791840746,"frozen_at_iso":"2026-10-12T21:32:26Z","frozen_sha":"2d9fedba028928adc18de522bf1ed72c3a2f8685","head_ref":"copilot/legacy-redis-agent-cleanup","head_repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","head_repo_id":210933087,"input_mode":"direct","launch_run":{"actor_id":218610,"attempt":1,"id":38305899421},"loop_kind":"copilot_review","metadata":{"body":"<!--\nCHANGELOG.md is generated from merged pull requests. Do not add an entry unless this PR introduces\na deprecation or breaking change.\n-->\n\nRemove the Lettuce 5.1 javaagent module so the Lettuce 5.0 integration covers all supported 5.0+ clients. Lettuce 4.x and the standalone Lettuce library remain supported.\n\nTo keep Lettuce instrumentation disabled, replace `otel.instrumentation.lettuce-5.1.enabled=false` with `otel.instrumentation.lettuce.enabled=false`; the version-specific 5.1 selector is no longer supported.\n\nRemove command-encoding event support from both the Java agent and the standalone library. Library callers must remove `LettuceTelemetryBuilder.setEncodingSpanEventsEnabled`; there is no replacement API:\n\n```java\n// Before\nbuilder.setEncodingSpanEventsEnabled(true).build();\n\n// After\nbuilder.build();\n```\n\nThe Java agent no longer supports `otel.instrumentation.lettuce.experimental.command-encoding-events.enabled`. Neither the agent nor the standalone library emits `redis.encode.start` or `redis.encode.end` span events.\n\nFor Lettuce 5.1+, agent telemetry now uses `io.opentelemetry.lettuce-5.0` instead of `io.opentelemetry.lettuce-5.1`. Update any filters or dashboards that match the old instrumentation scope.","title":"Remove Lettuce 5.1 javaagent module"},"mode":"publish","pr":20533,"pr_author_id":198982749,"protocol":"git-candidate-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at":1791837731,"generation":3,"max_pipelines":5,"phase":"a93ae9f07b3f4cc5b73fde1b44482f3a","profile":"git-candidate-v1","required_checks":[]},"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","repo_id":210933087,"request_id":"23515baf65d54f3cb81a2d7228e1bc67","schema":2,"source_private":false,"target_private":false,"workflow_ref":"review-loop-revisions/bb68514826ed27b756023e196d2f92f7e88fa58a","workflow_revision":"bb68514826ed27b756023e196d2f92f7e88fa58a"},"run":{"attempt":1,"conclusion":"failure","id":38311431448,"url":"https://github.com/trask/copilot-workflows/actions/runs/38311431448"},"schema":2,"seen_findings":["e87691cb74dfe7996946da01dabadbc502abeea8f4b3d6289dd4813daa257858","40b5470b416e3913d5fe16987ad432267167d98cacb1c23bb7038234a9c80d2b"],"seen_inline_findings":["0af5b563377384b268ad19acb493e839658cc3382271bb54a6e39e47c70b80b1","4ca456d5c29182bbee56137f26b3f7c8d921a43d28b176baf9842e4bfa8f2